      "label": "Garbhini Vyakaran (Charak Samhita)",
      "readingLevel": "analytical",
      "content": "A section of the ancient Ayurvedic text Charak Samhita on the development of the embryo and post-conception care: prescriptions for diet (aahara), daily routine and activities (vihar), and medicines (aushad), including recommended foods per month, massage, exercise, air/sunlight/moonlight exposure, aromas, and music for the expectant mother."
